  <title>
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">Help Rescue and Rehabilitate Threatened Primates</narrative>
  </title>
  <description>
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">Worryingly the demand for our 24hr emergency animal rescue and rehabilitation program has intensified over the years, due to increased development within Diani, Kenya. Therefore, this Campaign will help us ensure our much-needed animal welfare, rescue, and rehabilitation program is funded for the next four months. Also, this campaign aims to lift the financial worry from Team Colobus and allow the team to provide the best possible care and support needed for the primates in Diani to thrive.</narrative>
  </description>
